{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "098175bf-13c4-8bad-b819-6315646be96a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-16T11:50:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Joao Pacheco",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:47:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:47:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. Sorry, I'm going to keep my voice low. Somebody's sleeping here. I'm calling about my water and sewer bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:48:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. What's going on with the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:48:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I sent a payment from my bank, and it bounced. Came back. I want to know where that stands now. Is it showing as paid or not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:48:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can look into that. Can I have the name on the account and the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:48:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Joao Pacheco. P-A-C-H-E-C-O. I'd rather not give the address on this line, I'm on speaker. Is the name enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:48:33-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me try the name and see what comes up. [pause] Okay, I see the account. There's a payment attempt that was returned, so the balance is still open. It has not been applied."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:48:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So it's not paid."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:48:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct, not at this point. The returned payment doesn't count toward the bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:48:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Um, there's a line on the bill that says consumption. Can you explain that? What is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:49:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Consumption is the amount of water used during the billing period, as measured by your meter. The charge is based on that usage, and the sewer portion is tied to it as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:49:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's just how much water we used."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:49:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. It's the difference between the previous meter reading and the current one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:49:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Sorry, hold on. [pause] I'm standing in line at a farm store, getting eggs. It's a little loud. Can you still hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:49:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:49:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So, if I want to pay tonight, after you're closed, is there a way? Can I put it in the drop box? Would that count as on time if it goes in tonight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:49:55-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a payment drop box at City Hall, and you can also pay online through the city's website at any hour. Generally, a payment is dated by when it's received, so a box deposit tonight would typically be picked up with the next business day's mail and payments. I'd put it in the box before the due date instead of on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:50:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And online is anytime, so that's easier."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:50:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, online is available around the clock. Whichever you choose, I'd use a different payment method than the one that bounced."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:50:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Will there be a fee for the returned one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:50:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't see a fee noted here, but that may post separately. If one appears, it will show on your next statement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:50:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's all I need. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:50:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Pacheco. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:50:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
